INSERT INTO `landings` VALUES (2,'basement-finishing-and-remodeing-in-ellicott-city-md','Swift Basement Finishing and Remodeling in Ellicott City, MD | BasementRemodeling.com','Need fast and affordable basement remodeling and finishing services in Ellicott City, MD? BasementRemodeling.com is the contractor you need!','basement, finishing, remodeling, ellicott city, maryland, md, howard, county, contractor, company, licensed, insured, certified, affordable, top-rated, experienced, egress windows, walkouts, custom engineering, family room, bathroom, bedroom, gym, home theater, double doors, HVAC, 3d designs, 3d models','Basement Finishing and Remodeling in Ellicott City, MD','<p>Professional and organized approach to your Basement Finishing or Remodeling project from the Local Family-Owned Company</p>','Hundreds of Basements Finished','Click VIEW PORTFOLIO button to see our recent basement finishing and remodeling projects. Get inspired by visiting our Basement Ideas page.','BasementRemodeling.com was featured on House Smarts, which was aired on CNBC back in September of 2019. This basement is located in Potomac, MD, and was completed by BasementRemodeling.com (ex- Basement Masters) during the Spring of 2019 for Mr. and Mrs. Terlinsky. Our whole team thanks Alan and Joan for the opportunity to transform their dream of a smart basement into a reality.','The overwhelmingly positive reception from our clients makes Basement Remodeling Company stand out from other basement remodeling companies in Maryland. It definitely means something to us, and we think it should mean something to you, too!','Want to know what our past clients have to say about their basement remodeling experiences with Basement Remodeling Company?','We love our clients and they love us!','Licenses and Insurance','BasementRemodeling.com is a fully licensed and insured basement contractor in Maryland, Washington DC and Virginia. Our Virginia Class A Contractor License (VA Class A) number is 2705159425, our Maryland Home Improvement Commission License (MHIC) number is 129172 and our DC Class A Contractor License (DC Class A) number is 410516000631. We have posted copies of our basement remodeling licenses and insurance certificates below. Please note: any basement finishing or remodeling project requires a separate set of permits which should be pulled by a licensed contractor/electrician/plumber etc. You can easily check any contractors license here:','Follow us on Instagram','/public/upload/landings/2/d1eb91fb822b0d483017434fbecb1579','Basement Finishing & Remodeling Services with Fast Turnaround Times!','<p>At BasementRemodeling.com, we provide our services cities all across Maryland, including Ellicott City (Howard County)! BasementRemodeling.com has an extensive proven track record, affordable prices, lightning-fast turnaround times, and team of courteous professionals &mdash; what more could you want?</p>\r\n<p>Click the button below to find out more about what we do, how we do it, and why we\'re the basement contractor you need!</p>','39.2673283','-76.7983067','10','2020-10-18 09:15:53'),(3,'basement-finishing-and-remodeling-in-alexandria-va','Basement Finishing and Remodeling in Alexandria, VA','Need a highly-rated basement remodeling and finishing contractor in Alexandria, VA? BasementRemodeling.com is the contractor you\'re looking for!','basement, finishing, remodeling, alexandria, virginia, va, contractor, company, licensed, insured, certified, affordable, top-rated, experienced, egress windows, walkouts, custom engineering, family room, bathroom, bedroom, gym, home theater, double doors, HVAC, 3d designs, 3d models','Five-Star Rated Basement Finishing and Remodeling in Alexandria, VA','<p>Professional and organized approach to your Basement Finishing or Remodeling project from a Local, Family-Owned Company</p>','Hundreds of Basements Finished','Click VIEW PORTFOLIO button to see our recent basement finishing and remodeling projects. Get inspired by visi