INSERT INTO `portfolio` VALUES (114,'Rockville, MD New Construction','A beautiful new home in Rockville, MD with a uniform look that’s bold and inviting','Rockville MD, Rockville Maryland, Rockville Maryland new homes, LVT flooring, tiled shower, accent wall, laundry room, full bathroom, stair steps ideas','charen-ln-new-construction','Charen ln New Construction','Rockville, MD','11810 Charen ln, Potomac, MD, 20854','39.0495019','-77.166485',1,6800,332,'<p>A dazzling new home in Rockville, MD with a gently sloping backyard features an amazing sky blue exterior with white trimming, balcony walkway, rowed windows and a spectacular stone accent wall denoting the entrance. Inside, a heavily recessed, darkened door frame with dramatic side windows creates a striking impression against a neutral backdrop of soft grays, LVT flooring and recessed row lighting. The neutral motif extends into the kitchen and dining room (complete with wraparound countertops, cabinets, and a center island), varying only slightly in the living room area by incorporating crisp white-on-white walls, ceiling and trim in contrast to darker LVT flooring. An accent wall with artificial fireplace masterfully draws the eye.</p>\r\n<p>The laundry room has a stacked washer and dryer tucked away neatly across from a stairway with clean white railings and banisters that match the light tones of the LVT flooring. Four bedrooms each have an abundance of natural lighting while maintaining a distinct look and feel through sweeping architectural curves and strategic window placing. The master bathroom has separate toilets, matching extra-wide countertops with twin vanity mirrors and lighted frames, recessed lighting, and a tiled shower with a retractable wand and pull-open glass doors.</p>\r\n<p>Finally, the half-submerged ground floor boasts great acoustics and fun games in the music room, with LVT flooring and neutral gray colors. A giant metallic gray garage with white trimming has enough room for any car collector. Overall, a beautiful new home with a uniform look that&rsquo;s bold and inviting.</p>',0,0,'2020-09-22 15:54:40'),(115,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling Project - Springfield, VA','Stunning comprehensive basement remodeling project for a home in Springfield VA by BasementRemodeling.com','Basement finishing and remodeling, Springfield, VA, Springfield VA, basement renovation Springfield VA, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company, basement finishing, basement remodeling, basement design ideas, portfolio, basement contractor','basement-finishing-remodeling-in-springfield-va-20','Basement Finishing / Remodeling','Springfield, VA','8290 Swope Ct, Springfield, VA, 22153','38.7546938','-77.2310813',1,1803,361,'<p>At over 1,800 square feet, this basement remodeling project in Springfield VA is practically a full living space on its own! It features a full-size kitchenette and wet bar with marble counters, seating area, sink, cabinets, and even its own kegerator and beverage cooler. The family room has a comfortable seating area with wall-to-wall storage and shelving and an HD TV sits perfectly centered on an accent-tile wall in the middle. In between the wet-bar and the family room, atop lovely LVT flooring, is a pool table for anyone in the mood for a few games. The basement space also includes its own dedicated bathroom, with LVT flooring, shower, and a complimentary color-scheme. If that wasn\'t enough, a cozy home theater tops it all off! The home theater features a custom built media center with elevated seating (eight total seats) in a soft carpeted and closed-off room.</p>',1,1,'2020-09-22 16:05:08'),(116,'1402 S St. NW Rebuild Project | BasementRemodeling.com','A hip, modern, and stylishly urban rebuild of a home in Washington DC by BasementRemodeling.com','rebuild, basement contractor, washington dc, portfolio, basement remodeling contractor, basement finishing contractor','1402-s-st-nw-rebuild','1402 S st NW Rebuild','Washington, DC','1402 S st nw, Washington, DC','38.9138877','-77.0327769',1,1800,382,'<p>This contemporary Washington DC rowhouse rebuild project is hip, modern and stylishly urban. Wooden stair steps with white spindles and black banisters pop against a trendy accent wall with white baseboard molding and black flooring. A standalone column adds imaginary boundaries and height in the family room, which is further accentuated by tasteful low furniture, big bay windows, and a fireplace with custom mantle. The kitchen-like wet bar makes full use of a stunning corridor space by flanking it with custom cabinets, hidden LED lighting, extra-wide luxury sink, stainless-steel appliances,&nbsp;and under-stairs storage &ndash; topped off with a mini-laundry room in the closet by the glass door entrance.</p>\n<p>The second-floor bedroom is replete with full-sized furnishings, muted colors, ample closet space and plenty of light from dual double-hung windows and recessed lighting. An upgraded bathroom features a tiled tub surround, hopper windows, and vanity sink with overhead lighting. A second upgraded bathroom boasts a tiled shower enclosure with glass door, vanity sink,&nbsp;and overhead lighting.</p>',1,2,'2020-09-22 16:14:42'),(117,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling Project - Vienna, VA','A delightfully bright custom basement remodeling project in Vienna VA by BasementRemodeling.com','Basement finishing and remodeling Vienna VA, VA, basement renovation Vienna VA, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company, basement finishing, basement remodeling, basement design ideas, portfolio, basement contractor','basement-finishing-and-remodeling-in-vienna-va','Basement Finishing and Remodeling','Vienna, VA','2526 Flint Hill Rd, Vienna, VA, 22181','38.8934477','-77.2817523',1,1475,403,'<p>This project, designed by BasementRemodeling.com, is for a home in Vienna, VA, and is chock full of aesthetically pleasing features. This sleek and light-focused basement project includes a large family room, custom-built cabinetry, custom media center, kitchen-like wet bar, home theater, gym, full bathroom, and a lot more. Leading to the family room is a kitchen-like wet-bar with a full-size fridge, marble counters, and large dining area. The family room has LVT flooring, large seating area, coffee table, and in-wall cabinetry (meaning it\'s flush with the walls on both sides) with a media center in the middle.</p>\r\n<p>A large sliding barn-style door separates the family room from a spacious home theater. The home theater includes a custom media center with a surround sound system, plenty of comfortable seating space and gray walls for optimal movie watching. A lone decorative column marks the path to a small gym area large enough for two full-size machines and a full-size bathroom with a unique accented-tile design inside the shower. The total basement measures up to 1,475 square feet, offers plenty of fresh designs and space, and never feels too dark!</p>',0,3,'2020-09-22 16:18:00'),(118,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling Project #3 - Olney, MD','This Basement remodel features unique shelving space underneath the stairs,  decorative column, LVT flooring and a modern home theatre system. Wet bar with marble-themed countertops. Full bathroom includes ceramic mosaic shower pan, a designer mosaic inlay, and a state-of-the-art rain shower system for a truly refreshing experience.','Basement finishing and remodeling Olney MD, basement renovation Olney Maryland, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company.','basement-finishing-and-remodeling-olney-md-16-03','Basement Finishing / Remodeling, Project #3','Olney, Maryland','Olney, MD 20832','39.1457139','-77.067959',1,1490,423,'<p>An architectural masterpiece, this Olney, Maryland basement remodel project features sweeping angles and other dramatic engineering feats that will add layers of sophistication to any downstairs domain. Unique shelving space is built directly underneath the stairs, and a decorative column adds visual depth to the striking lavender blue bedroom area, which is complete with LVT flooring and a modern home theatre system. A snug kitchen walkway (also LVT) is surrounded by gorgeous jet black floor cabinets, sink, wet bar (with a glass-plated wooden wine rack), and marble-themed countertops that are sure to delight all. The bathroom has been upgraded with an elaborate ceramic mosaic shower pan, a designer mosaic inlay, and a state-of-the-art rain shower system for a truly refreshing experience.</p>',1,4,'2020-09-22 16:21:34'),(119,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling Project #12 - Columbia, MD','Check out this lovely and colorful Columbia, MD basement remodeling and finishing project by BasementRemodeling.com!','Basement finishing and remodeling Columbia MD, basement renovation Columbia Maryland, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company, basement remodeling, basement finishing, basement renovation, portfolio, basement design ideas','basement-finishing-and-remodeling-columbia-md-14-11','Basement Finishing / Remodeling, Project #12','Columbia, Maryland','10801 Dundee dr, Columbia,MD,21044','39.1987189','-76.88572119999999',1,1125,435,'<p>Your basement should be more than just a storage space, so why not to finish it into an area for the entire family to enjoy? A bright and festive family room &ndash; complete with a separate children&rsquo;s play area &ndash; adds a contemporary touch to your downstairs den; notice the extra-resilient LVT flooring! This basement project features a sleek kitchenette, equipped with modern appliances, and a classic wet bar with accompanying marbled-topped island centerpiece, is perfect for entertaining guests. The fully-upgraded bathroom includes custom-made ceramic wall tiling, a marble mosaic shower pan and an elevated curb. To recap, this is a beautiful family area, kids&rsquo; room, wet bar, kitchenette, and luxury washroom &ndash; all in one basement remodel!</p>',0,5,'2020-09-22 16:24:40'),(120,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling Project #3 - Fairfax, Virginia','Basement Finishing and Remodeling, Fairfax, VA with a family room, suspended ceiling lights, luxury vinyl tile (LVT), dining area, tiled shower with a deluxe shower pan by Kohler.','Basement finishing and remodeling Fairfax VA, basement renovation Fairfax Virginia, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company.','basement-finishing-and-remodeling-fairfax-va-11-11','Basement Finishing / Remodeling, Project #3','Fairfax, Virginia','9014 Littleton St Fairfax, VA 22032','38.8367762','-77.257353',1,1250,445,'<p>This extravagant remodeling project begins with a spacious family room outfitted with a white-paneled fireplace and an abundance of plush sitting furniture arranged for cozy, extended conversations.&nbsp; A cream theme with suspended ceiling lights adds a timeless touch that will never go out of style, and makes the area appear larger and more open. The luxury vinyl tile (LVT) flooring expands from the family room into the fully-equipped dining area, which is complete with the most modern stainless steel appliances and a standalone centerpiece island for casual dining. The surrounds shower has been upgraded with immaculate ceramic tiling and a deluxe shower pan by Kohler &ndash; an industry leader you can trust.</p>',0,6,'2020-09-22 16:27:16'),(121,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling Project #2 - Upper Marlboro, MD','A basement remodel in Upper Marlboro, MD gets an updated look that is both masculine and modern. Light-colored LVT flooring and a pale blue color scheme immerses the room in soft textures, starting with the medium wet bar that has recessed row lighting, granite countertops, trendy shelving and modern appliances. To the right of the wet bar are two sliding glass doors leading to a grand walk-out entrance with handrails. The family room has a long white wraparound couch and a projectile home theater along with columns and a billiard table. To the left are plush velvet chairs and marvelous artificial fireplace mo