t screen television. Premium LVT flooring extends into the snazzy kids&rsquo; playroom with double pocket doors, and plenty of space for storage and playtime. The small kitchenette and dining area borrows geometric inspiration from the Art Deco era &ndash; as evidenced by the bold patterns on the wooden tabletop, and the creative overhead light fixture in the shape of a mock lightbulb. A half bathroom with ceramic mosaic tiled floor completes the stylish motif.</p>',1,10,'2020-09-22 16:41:23'),(125,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling project in Elliott City, Maryland','Looking for great basement lighting ideas? See the best basement design options the East Coast has to offer with this new and elegant Ellicott City, MD basement!','Basement finishing and remodeling, basement renovation, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company, best basement design options, Ellicott City MD, Maryland, basement contractor, finished basement portfolio','basement-finishing-remodeling-elliott-city-maryland','Basement Finishing / Remodeling','Elliott City, Maryland','11512 Fox River Dr, Ellicott City, MD 21042','39.2350161','-76.9103774',1,1400,510,'<p>This Ellicott City, MD basement project is loaded with the best basement design options we have to offer. The full-sized kitchen-like wet bar features wraparound marble countertop with stunning tiled accents, matching dark floor and wall cabinetry, modern appliances, hanging vanity lamps and swanky LVT flooring. A wide open teal space with recessed lighting and egress windows feels bright and energetic, as does the tan wing (with matching features and even more window space). A full-sized gym and dance studio combination features a soothing light blue color scheme with gigantic wall mirrors that double the room&rsquo;s size, and triples its functionality. Finally, a bright and creamy full bathroom has a tub enclosure, vanity sink, tiled floor and oval vanity mirror with overhead light fixtures.</p>',0,11,'2020-09-22 16:43:47'),(126,