mpanying &ldquo;window&rdquo; built into the wall of the kids&rsquo; playroom turns this remarkable play place into a &ldquo;home within a home&rdquo; &ndash; literally! A bathroom with tub enclosure by Kohler and a beautiful beige matching granite countertop.</p>',0,14,'2020-09-22 16:53:06'),(129,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling Project #3 - Mount Airy, MD','This Mount Airy, MD basement remodel is a combination of tasteful, elegant, and untraditional. BasementRemodeling.com','Basement finishing and remodeling Mount Airy MD, basement renovation Mount Airy Maryland, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company, basement finishing, basement remodeling, basement contractor','basement-finishing-and-remodeling-mount-airy-md-15-06','Basement Finishing / Remodeling','Mount Airy, MD','5915 Woodville Rd Mount Airy MD 21771','39.3947809','-77.181376',1,980,562,'<p>A bright and flashy loft in Mount Airy, MD shows that not all basements remodeling projects have to follow the rules and be ordinary. A tasteful flight of stairs with iron spindles leads to an untraditional bedroom with hidden access doors and stunning grape purple accent wall. The soft and airy family room is ivory with a robin egg blue accent wall, and stretches into a small office stocked with all of the latest work-related equipment. A bright and cheerful bathroom with tub enclosure and elevated window shares the robin-egg-and-ivory color patterns. The kitchen-like wet bar has a full-sized fridge, stainless steel dishwasher and microwave.</p>',1,15,'2020-09-22 16:54:56'),(130,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling Project in Rockville, MD','This basement in Rockville, MD includes stair railings with iron spindles descend into a huge family room, which utilizes premium LVT. Two separate seating areas. A luxurious, bathroom features a fanciful ceramic tiled shower with inviting glass doors.','Basement finishing and remodeling Rockville MD, basement renovation Rockville Maryland, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company.','basement-finishing-and-remodeling-rockville-md-15-05','Basement Finishing / Remodeling','Rockville, MD','6130 Lux Lane Rockville, Md 20852','39.03431620000001','-77.1286293',1,950,573,'<p>The sheer size of this beautiful basement project in Rockville, MD is sure to impress anyone who lays eyes upon it. Lavish stair railings with iron spindles descend into a huge family room, which utilizes premium LVT planks for the best look and feel. The family area is large enough to accommodate two separate seating areas &ndash; so big, in fact, that the sectional sofa becomes dwarfed in comparison to the wide open space surrounding it. A luxurious, all-white washroom features a fanciful ceramic tiled shower with inviting glass doors. Overall, a roomy dwelling that has a terrific look and feel.</p>',1,16,'2020-09-22 16:56:43'),(131,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling Project #11 - Columbia, MD','Basement finishing and remodeling Columbia MD. Double French doors, built-in fireplace and a gently swaying ceiling fan. The living room is quite spacious and features laminate flooring, wonderful wet bar and kitchenette combo.','Basement finishing and remodeling Columbia MD, basement renovation Columbia Maryland, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company.','basement-finishing-and-remodeling-columbia-md-13-06','Basement Finishing / Remodeling, Project #11','Columbia, Maryland','10925 Shadow ln, Columbia, 21044','39.1974202','-76.89067419999999',1,1030,584,'<p>This refined and rustic remodeling project utilizes simple, wide open spaces to its fullest potential for a timeless, elegant look. As soon as they walk through the window-encased double French doors, your family and friends are welcomed immediately by a built-in fireplace and a gently swaying ceiling fan. The cream-themed paint job fully opens the room, and the laminate flooring is a low-cost material that is easy to install and especially resistant to scuffs &ndash; and just look at that polished shi