atching LVT flooring, white trim, and a delightful stenciled mock house entrance that\'s perfect for both storage and play). A full-sized wet bar seamlessly separates the family room using wraparound counters and marble countertops. A full bathroom comes complete with LVT tiling, tiled shower enclosure, marble sinktops and vanity lamps. Best of all, down the wooden stairs with wrought iron railings and beyond the glass door, lies a full wine cellar with climate controls.</p>',0,20,'2020-09-22 17:05:52'),(135,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling Project #3 - North Potomac, MD','This North Potomac, MD remodel includes a spacious family room with LVT flooring, kitchen-like wet bar and an aged cabinetry case. The laundry nook with utility sink is perfectly concealed by a modest privacy wall. Full bathroom with a shower enclosure.','Basement finishing and remodeling North Potomac MD, basement renovation North Potomac Maryland, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company.','basement-finishing-and-remodeling-north-potomac-md-16-01','Basement Finishing / Remodeling, Project #3','North Potomac, MD','14220 Quince Orchard rd North Potomac MD 20878','39.0894668','-77.25124679999999',1,1040,630,'<p>If you are looking for a contemporary basement design that&rsquo;s both modern and masculine, this North Potomac, MD remodel project is the perfect source of inspiration for you. Rustic brown leather furniture over dark LVT planking and sunflower yellow walls creates a family room and kitchen-like wet bar with rich depths and touchable textures. An aged cabinetry case, Jamaican blue, breaks up the pleasantly monochromatic presentation. The laundry nook with working basin is perfectly concealed by a modest privacy wall. Across is the upgraded bathroom with a shower enclosure for an open feel. The refreshing look of this peaceful and relaxing den promotes both good nature and good health.</p>',0,21,'2020-09-22 17:07:27'),(136,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling Project in Pasadena, Ma