ooden double doors is another large room that could comfortably serve as a secluded guest bedroom or as the ultimate storage room (notice the understairs storage as well). Across from the mock house entrance is a family room with wall-mounted HDTV and hookups for a full entertainment center. A full bathroom with pale yellow walls sharply contrasts with a clean white marble countertop, white tiled flooring and a tiled shower with tub enclosure by Kohler.</p>',0,24,'2020-09-22 17:12:53'),(139,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling in Alexandria, VA — Basement Finishing and Remodeling in Maryland, DC and Virginia.','','','basement-finishing-and-remodeling-in-alexandria-va','Basement Finishing / Remodeling','Alexandria, VA','2001 Commonwealth Avenue, Alexandria, VA, 22301','38.8237075','-77.06254009999999',1,576,702,'',1,25,'2020-09-22 17:14:21'),(140,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling in Edgewater, MD — Basement Finishing and Remodeling in Maryland, DC and Virginia.','','','basement-finishing-and-remodeling-in-edgewater-md','Basement Finishing / Remodeling','Edgewater, MD','2 Brick Church, Edgewater, MD, 21037','38.9116356','-76.58063229999999',1,950,704,'',0,26,'2020-09-22 17:15:39'),(141,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling Project in Gaithersburg, MD','Classy Gaithersburg, MD basement renovation project by BasementRemodeling.com','Basement finishing and remodeling Gaithersburg MD, basement renovation Gaithersburg Maryland, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company. basement, contractor, finishing, remodeling, portfolio','basement-finishing-and-remodeling-gaithersburg-md-16-01','Basement Finishing / Remodeling','Gaithersburg, MD','9401 Thornedike dr Gaithersburg, MD 20882','39.2216515','-77.19104329999999',1,1200,717,'<p>This Gaithersburg, MD renovation project is the perfect blend of traditional and modern motifs.&nbsp;High grade&nbsp;LVT, double-hung French windows, and a classic brick fireplace with nearby decorative column gives the family room a timeless appearan