upplemental heating and access door is painted bright purple with a dark blue accent wall for dramatic effect. The laundry room and full bathroom are both painted a much lighter purple, the latter containing a shower enclosure, tiled floor, and a sink with high-rise cabinetry.</p>',0,35,'2020-09-22 17:35:24'),(150,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling Project #5 - Bowie, MD','This basement remodel in Bowie, MD has a family room, with a charming television-and-book shelving combo. The LTV flooring leads from the family room into the kitchenette area, creating a pleasing uniform appearance that is familiar and warm. The lavish bedroom doubles as a small office. The full bathroom includes tile flooring a shower with enclosure by Kohler and sliding glass door.','Basement finishing and remodeling Bowie MD, basement renovation Bowie Maryland, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company.','basement-finishing-and-remodeling-bowie-md-15-09','Basement Finishing / Remodeling, Project #5','Bowie, MD','3200 Abacus Ct Bowie MD 20716','38.9324917','-76.722965',1,1100,808,'<p>Bright, festive and open are three ways to describe this terrific basement remodel project in Bowie, MD. By painting one wall macaroon and the other an eggshell white, and by recessing the ceiling ever so slightly, new layers of depth and visual space are made available in the family room, where an overstuffed hazelnut loveseat faces a charming television-and-book shelving combo. The LTV flooring leads from the family room into the kitchenette area (which is complete with sectional cabinets, granite countertops, and stainless a steel refrigerator), creating a pleasing uniform appearance that is familiar and warm.&nbsp; The lavish bedroom with Sunday green accent wall doubles as a small office. The full bathroom includes tile flooring a shower with enclosure by Kohler and sliding glass door.</p>',0,36,'2020-09-22 17:36:47'),(151,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling Project #12 - Ellicott City, MD','This Ellicot