e that every corner looks fun while being put to good use. Dark LVT planking compliments the lilac-painted dancing room, which has a stunning two-toned support beam and wall-to-wall studio mirroring, the same as professional dancers use!</p>',0,43,'2020-09-22 17:53:16'),(158,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling Project in Edgewater, Maryland','If you are looking for professional basement finishing and remodeling ideas in Edgewater, MD, you’ve got to see this fully finished basement!','basement remodeling ideas, basement finishing, kitchen-like wet bar, decorative column, LVT tiling, basement portfolio, project, edgewater MD, Maryland, Edgewater basement, design, contractor','basement-finishing-remodeling-edgewater-maryland','Basement Finishing / Remodeling','Edgewater, Maryland','4060 Muddy Creek Rd, Harwood, MD 20776','38.889821','-76.5741029',1,1180,888,'<p>This Edgewater, MD basement estate project shows how the correct pairing of wood can invoke emotion in a room. Down the wooden steps with matching wooden stair railings lies an open and inviting mustard layout with LVT tiling and wraparound white floor trim. The decorative column tastefully separates the family area (with HDTV entertainment center) from the dining nook and kitchen-like wet bar with modern appliances, marble countertops, and light wooden cabinets. Through the adjacent barn door is a well-equipped laundry room with washer and dryer, LVT flooring, and recessed lighting.</p>',0,44,'2020-09-22 17:56:01'),(159,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling Project #4 - Potomac, Maryland','A remodeled basement in Potomac, Maryland now has all of the latest interior trends, starting with a cream-themed family room with egress windows, wall-mounted HDTV hookups, and a dazzling tiger orange accent wall.','basement remodeling, basement renovation project, general contractor, basement finishing, potomac, maryland','basement-finishing-remodeling-potomac-md','Basement Finishing / Remodeling, Project #4','Potomac, Maryland','9423 Jongroner ct, Potomac, MD 20854','39.05187','-77.19445739999999',1,800,917,'<p>A remodeled basement project in Potomac, Maryland now has all of the latest interior trends, starting with a cream-themed family room with egress windows, wall-mounted HDTV hookups, and a dazzling tiger orange accent wall. Flowing carpet transitions into casual LVT flooring to signify the full-sized wet bar space, which is complete with wraparound granite counters and cabinets, wine rack, HDTV hookups, egress window, hanging lamps, luxury sink and dual taps. Beyond the French double glass doors is cozy enclosure, opened up nicely by a striking sapphire blue accent wall and opposing egress window (and beautifully-rowed recessed lighting throughout). The basement ensemble is completed by a steel blue full bathroom with vanity lamps, luxury sink basin, and tub enclosure by Kohler.</p>',0,45,'2020-09-22 17:58:26'),(160,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling Project #4 - Bowie, MD','Come see what Basement Masters has done to this Bowie, MD basement – and what they can do for yours!','Basement finishing and remodeling, basement renovation, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company, Bowie MD','basement-finishing-remodeling-bowie-maryland','Basement Finishing / Remodeling, Project #4','Bowie, MD','11905 Webb Court, Bowie, MD','39.0012763','-76.7994006',1,1180,920,'<p>A basement project in Bowie, MD is fully revitalized with a double-door entranceway that segues from the outside into an artic blue wonderland with bright white ceilings and floor trim, LVT flooring, a decorative column, and a refrigerator unit neatly tucked away in a pocket corner. The stair railing with half-wall effortlessly glides upstairs. In the next room over, things suddenly turn delightfully terra cotta with white trim and ceiling, a push-out window and recessed lighting. The full-sized bathroom is delightfully modern with a slate blue walls and tile floors, shower enclosure with sliding glass door, and deluxe pop-out medicine cabinet with vanity mirror.</p>',0,46,'2020-09-22 18:01:08'),(161,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling Project #3 - Fulton, Maryland','Clean cream colors gives this Fulton, Maryland basement a crisp and uniform appearance that offers a balanced and well-organized first impression.','Basement remodeling, basement renovation, basement finish, general contractor, project, fulton, maryland','basement-finishing-remodeling-fulton-2-md','Basement Finishing / Remodeling, Project #3','Fulton, Maryland','761 Aspring Ave, Fulton, MD 20759','39.1605745','-76.91047139999999',1,1200,935,'<p>Clean cream colors gives this Fulton, Maryland basement project a crisp and uniform appearance that offers a balanced and well-organized first impression. This basement is a perfect example of how a wide open space can be easily divided into separate living areas using little more than high quality carpet and LVT flooring. A large portion is dedicated to the family room, which has hookups for a wall-mounted HDTV, along with a privacy window and an entertainment center. The other half of the room seamlessly transitions into a kids\' playroom complete with a mock stencil blue house entrance. The kitchen-like wet bar is neatly bordered by LVT flooring and has a wine rack, modern appliances, vanity sink, marble countertops and a double hung window. Recessed lighting and white trim throughout completes the modern look. A full baby blue bathroom with white trim, LVT flooring, extra wide mirror, vanity lights, and a long marble countertop is crowned by a beautiful tiled shower with tub enclosure by Kohler.</p>',0,47,'2020-09-22 18:04:14'),(162,'Basement finishing and remodeling project #9 - Columbia, MD','This classic Columbia, MD basement has two-tone columns and a series of soft row lighting that can serve as a family room, kids’ playroom, billiard room, or whatever else. A corner wet bar with overhead wine rack. The full bathroom includes a tub enclosure, ceramic tile flooring and a striking sink countertop made from black marble.','Basement finishing and remodeling Columbia MD, basement renovation Columbia Maryland, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company.','basement-finishing-and-remodeling-columbia-md-13-11','Basement Finishing / Remodeling, Project #9','Columbia, MD','8726 Sage brush way, Columbia, MD, 21045','39.1934352','-76.8081936',1,1050,946,'<p>This classic Columbia, MD basement project is sure to please everyone with its simple and stylish aesthetic. Two-tone columns and a series of soft row lighting&nbsp;helps&nbsp;underscore an abundance of cream-colored floor space that can serve as a family room, kids&rsquo; playroom, billiard room, or whatever else you can dream of &ndash; the designing possibilities are simply endless! A corner wet bar with overhead wine rack and stone accent wall creates a cozy and distinguishing focal point. The full bathroom includes a tub enclosure, ceramic tile flooring and a striking sink countertop made from black marble.</p>',0,48,'2020-09-22 18:05:57'),(163,'Basement finishing and remodeling project, Gambrills MD| Basement Masters','This basement remodeling project in Gambrills, MD features the faux wood tile flooring through the kitchenette and matches the wall-to-wall cabinets. Also here is a family room and the full bathroom with a decorative vanity mirror, overhead lamps, shower enclosure by Kohler with retractable wand, built-in shelving, and a tiled floor. A smaller closet has been converted into a mini-laundry room.  ','Basement finishing and remodeling Gambrills MD, basement renovation Gambrills Maryland, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company.','basement-finishing-and-remodeling-gambrills-14-02','Basement Finishing / Remodeling','Gambrills, MD','2413 Arapaho Way, Gambrills, MD 21054','39.03487860000001','-76.672516',1,1160,953,'<p>A lime design creates warm and inviting undertones to give this Gambrills, MD basement project&nbsp;a delightfully soft touch. Light-colored fau