&nbsp;and extra wide sink top&nbsp;rounds&nbsp;out the basement&rsquo;s design nicely.</p>',0,50,'2020-09-22 18:10:01'),(165,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling Project #2 - Kensington, MD','This basement remodel in Kensington, MD begins from a family room, which is highlighted by LVT flooring, TV with floor speakers sound system, white column, and traditional brick fireplace, foosball table right in front of full-size egress window. A laundry room features a washer and dryer combo, floor-to-ceiling cabinetry, suspended countertops, slate gray tiled flooring, and a deluxe wash basin (utility sink). The full bathroom includes a tiled shower with decorative mosaic border, glass doors, retractable stainless steel washing wand, and a built-in ledge.','Basement finishing and remodeling Kensington MD, basement renovation Kensington Maryland, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company.','basement-finishing-and-remodeling-kensington-md-15-11','Basement Finishing / Remodeling, Project #2','Kensington, MD','9918 old spring rd, Kensington, MD 20895','39.0202521','-77.0703198',1,830,970,'<p>Fun and fashion go hand-in-hand with this trendy Kensington, MD downstairs getaway project. The fresh new look begins in the warm and bright family room, which is highlighted by LVT flooring, velvety smooth sitting furniture, HDTV with&nbsp;floor&nbsp;speakers sound system, white column, and traditional brick fireplace. The fun continues with foosball table right in front of&nbsp;full-size&nbsp;egress window. A clean and efficient laundry room, painted lemon yellow, features a washer and dryer combo, floor-to-ceiling cabinetry, suspended countertops, slate gray tiled flooring, and a deluxe wash basin. The full bathroom includes a tiled shower with decorative mosaic border, pull-out glass doors with vanity knobs, retractable stainless steel washing wand, and a built-in ledge.</p>',0,51,'2020-09-22 18:11:57'),(166,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling Project #3 - Odenton, MD','A clean basement in Odenton, MD offers plenty of great basement ideas straight from the top design experts at BasementRemodeling.com!','basement ideas, basement design, basement finishing and remodeling, Odenton MD, LVT flooring, basement remodeling, basement finishing, portfolio','basement-finishing-remodeling-odenton-maryland','Basement Finishing / Remodeling, Project #3','Odenton, MD','490 Lisa Ave Odenton, MD 21113','39.073773','-76.68253899999999',1,1100,981,'<p>Want to have a crisp clean basement like this one in Odenton, MD? A two-tone cream color scheme accentuates architecture and enlarges a wide open family room with this basement project by BasementRemodeling.com. The aged barn door sharply contrasts with the light colors to give an authentic, rustic vibe. The column serves as an excellent centerpiece to both frame the basement and create an imaginary boundary leading into the medium-sized wet bar, which is replete with wine rack, floor and wall cabinetry, marble countertop, and modern appliances (note how the LVT flooring and tiled accent wall combine to add movement and flow). Twin half-walls with columns and a high archway combine to create a space that is pleasantly closed off yet quite visible. A full bathroom with LVT flooring, Kohler tub enclosure and a brilliant marble countertop (with matching shower curtains) pair the perfect basement ideas together to add the final touch.</p>',0,52,'2020-09-22 18:13:44'),(167,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling Project #4 - Annapolis, MD','This basement remodel in Annapolis, MD basement has a video games playroom with triple HDTVs mounted onto the wall, leather armchairs with built-in drink holders, and a recessed ceiling with LED lighting and built-in speakers. A wet bar includes a wine rack, stainless steel appliances, and sleek black marble counter. The full bathroom features a tiled shower with mosaic tile on the walls and floor, marble curb and glass doors.','Basement finishing and remodeling Annapolis MD, basement renova