t grey appearance throughout extends into the bathroom, which has a tub enclosure with shower lighting, extra-wide wash basin and vanity canister lights.</p>',0,54,'2020-09-22 18:17:11'),(169,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling Project - Washington, DC','An attractive and urban style finished basement in Washington, DC. Expertly designed and implemented by BasementRemodeling.com.','Basement finishing and remodeling Washington, DC, basement renovation Washington, DC, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company, basement remodeling, basement finishing, portfolio, basement contractor','basement-remodeling-washington-dc-19-04','Basement Finishing / Remodeling','Washington, DC','914 Evarts ST NE, Washington, DC','38.9246668','-76.9931637',1,300,1015,'<p>An attractive finished basement project in Washington DC successfully adds urban style and valuable floorspace using light color tones, white baseboard molding and darker LVT flooring. A classic stair step design with white spindles and wooden banisters gives way to a wide-open floorspace with recessed lighting and privacy windows. Around the standalone column is a built-in refrigerator that could be the beginning of a kitchen-like wet bar or family room. Nestled at the end of a short hallway is a private upgraded bathroom with an extra-tall vanity sink, overhead lighting, shower enclosure with curb, LVT flooring and sliding basement window.</p>',0,55,'2020-09-22 18:18:47'),(170,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling Project #2 - Olney, MD','This Olney, MD basement remodel features a kids’ playroom, a storage room with wiring shelving and the full bathroom with a shower enclosure with glass doors and a ceramic tiled floor.','Basement finishing and remodeling Olney MD, basement renovation Olney Maryland, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company.','basement-finishing-and-remodeling-olney-md-2015-10','Basement Finishing / Remodeling, Project #2','Olney, MD','17532 Princess Anne dr, Olney, MD 20832','39.1461557000