ice, painted Sunday green, with column and white trimming, offset by striking black office equipment and work desk. When the day&rsquo;s work is finished, however, a neutral-toned home theatre room awaits, fully equipped with a ceiling-mounted projector and screen, foldout ping pong table, recessed ceiling, and functional shelving under the stairs space. The full bathroom includes a tub enclosure, patterned ceramic tiling, and white granite countertop. With this transitional basement, there&rsquo;s plenty of time for work and play!</p>',0,58,'2020-09-22 18:23:27'),(173,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling Project - Mclean, VA','A unique, spacious, and full of natural light describe this remodeling project in Mclean VA by BasementRemodeling.com','Basement finishing and remodeling Mclean VA, basement renovation Mclean VA, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company, basement contractor, finishing, remodeling, portfolio, wine storage, basement remodeling ideas, basement remodeling projects','basement-finishing-and-remodeling-in-mclean-va-1','Basement Finishing / Remodeling','Mclean, VA','1125 Duchess Dr, Mclean, VA, 22102','38.950933','-77.22190119999999',1,925,1066,'<p>This unique basement remodeling project, which was designed and completed by BasementRemodeling.com, was for a home in Mclean VA. A beautiful spiral staircase with black railing and wood-coated steps leads from the main floor down to the basement. The basement family room is spacious, with plenty of both artificial and natural light. The side of family room features a sizeable bar-type seating area with an adjacent cabinet/countertop combo with plenty of storage and a sink. A portion of the countertop is tucked behind a wall, with the corner showcasing tasteful wall-mounted storage racks for a wine collection. The basement also features a full-size bathroom, with a shower surrounded by tile and a sliding glass door entrance. Overall, the basement area measures a total of 925 square feet.</p>',0,59,