 professional sound system, home viewing screen, and adjustable cinematic lighting.&nbsp; When you are done eating popcorn, a carrot orange gym room with a cycling fitness station, and a pineapple yellow ping pong&nbsp;room,&nbsp;are perfect solutions for keeping those calories off. An all-purpose lounge area with tile flooring and small wet bar tops off the recreational possibilities, and a full teal bathroom features granite countertops, a tub enclosure, and tile flooring. &nbsp;</p>',0,62,'2020-09-22 18:38:07'),(177,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling Project #9 - Ellicott City, MD','This Ellicott City, MD basement remodeling includes a family room, which is complete with a wall-mounted entertainment system. In addition to traditional kids’ playroom, there is another small kids’ room under the stairs. An upgraded full bathroom with ceramic tiled shower with marble curb.','Basement finishing and remodeling Ellicott City MD, basement renovation Ellicott City Maryland, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company.','basement-finishing-and-remodeling-ellicott-city-md-14-10','Basement Finishing / Remodeling, Project #9','Ellicott City, MD','5023 Amber Meadow Vista, Ellicott city, MD,21043','39.2420957','-76.7989607',1,1320,1100,'<p>Artistic and inviting describes this Ellicott City, MD basement remodeling project, which utilizes sparse decorations and natural accents to create seemingly infinite amounts of space. Clear and modern lines and a light color pattern gives an upbeat feel to the expansive family room, which is complete with a wall-mounted entertainment system. The children are especially lucky &ndash; in additional to traditional kids&rsquo; playroom, there is another small kids&rsquo; room under the stairs with a stenciled tree on the wall and a starry twilight backdrop on the ceiling. An upgraded bathroom with honey-colored walls and ceramic tiled shower with marble curb completes the pleasing aesthetic.</p>',0,63,'2020-09-22 18:40:14'),(178,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling Project #8 - Ellicott City, Maryland','For this basement in Ellicott City, MD, twin decorative columns boldly outline a spacious family room area that also has a wall-mounted HDTV, white trim, and a dark wooden cabinet entertainment center.','basement remodeling, basement renovation, basement finishing, general contractor, basement project, elliott city, maryland, md','basement-finishing-remodeling-ellicott-city-3-md','Basement Finishing / Remodeling, Project #8','Ellicott City, Maryland','3136 Emerald Valley Rd, Ellicott City, Maryland, 21042','39.284814','-76.9248281',1,1350,1115,'<p>For this basement project in Ellicott City, MD, twin decorative columns boldly outline a spacious family room area that also has a wall-mounted HDTV, white trim, and a dark wooden cabinet entertainment center. Recessed lighting and a glass door entrance combines with double hung windows for an abundance of warm lighting. The room\'s bright color scheme pairs well with light-colored LVT flooring, which extends from the family room all the way to laundry room (with a washer-and-dryer-combo and stainless steel wash basin) and ends at the beautiful wooden staircase with half-wall and guardrail. A full bathroom completes this bathroom with dark cabinets to contrast against a light exterior, LVT flooring, vanity lamps and pristine shower enclosure.</p>',0,64,'2020-09-22 18:42:03'),(179,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling Project #2 - Fulton, MD','Less is more with this Fulton, MD basement that is void of furniture but high in architectural content. Take a look for basement ideas!','Basement finishing and remodeling, basement renovation, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company, basement architecture, Fulton MD','basement-finishing-remodeling-fulton-maryland','Basement Finishing / Remodeling, Project #2','Fulton, MD','11469 Iager Blvd Fulton, MD 20759','39.1585681','-76.91060039999999',1,1800,1118,'<p>This Fulton, MD basement project is an architectural dream &ndash; full decorative columns, ample window space, long half-walls with columns, stair railings with half-walls, and rich angles steeply bathed in just the right amount of recessed lighting leaves a fully-livable robin&rsquo;s egg blue downstairs waiting for furniture and other final touches. A small amount of LVT flooring is exposed in the corner for a future medium-sized wet bar, and pale lime full bathroom has a tiled floor, vanity lighting, and a tub enclosure by Kohler.</p>',0,65,'2020-09-22 18:44:00'),(180,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling Project #8 - Columbia, MD','This Columbia, MD basement has a cherry red love seat. LVT flooring and a delightful kitchenette with overhead cabinets, a full-sized stainless steel refrigerator unit, and a microwave that’s perfect for fun snacks and quick meals. A full bathroom includes tiled shower (with frameless door) and marble tile flooring.','Basement finishing and remodeling Columbia MD, basement renovation Columbia Maryland, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company.','basement-finishing-and-remodeling-columbia-md-15-01','Basement Finishing / Remodeling, Project #8','Columbia, MD','5215 Durham Road East, Columbia, MD 21044','39.22740960000001','-76.8638532',1,820,1129,'<p>With a basement like this Columbia, MD redesign project, your home will truly give others a great impression from the ground up! A cherry red love seat pops against the family room&rsquo;s soft green interior walls, and dual decorative beams accentuate a clean design that has plenty of architectural&nbsp;flair&nbsp;to offer. LVT flooring effortlessly carries you into a delightful kitchenette with overhead cabinets, a full-sized stainless steel refrigerator unit, and a microwave that&rsquo;s perfect for fun snacks and quick meals. A full bathroom includes tiled shower (with frameless door), marble tile flooring and an immaculate eggshell white finish.</p>',0,66,'2020-09-22 18:45:59'),(181,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling Project - Washington, DC','A basement in Washington DC turned into an apartment with plenty of new appliances and features by BasementRemodeling.com','Basement finishing and remodeling Washington DC, basement renovation Washington DC, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company, basement contractor, finishing, remodeling, portfolio, wine storage, basement remodeling ideas, basement remodeling projects','basement-finishing-and-remodeling-in-washington-dc-1','Basement Finishing / Remodeling','Washington, DC','4402 Kansas Ave NW, Washington, DC, 20011','38.9442402','-77.0244518',1,500,1156,'<p>This project by BasementRemodeling.com is a complete remodel specifically for a downstairs apartment in Washington, DC. We installed a variety of new features to transform this basement into an apartment! BasementRemodeling.com installed a new outside entrance, a kitchen-like wet-bar and LVT flooring in the family room, a new egress window in the bedroom, and a bathtub enclosure in the bathroom.</p>',0,67,'2020-09-22 18:47:48'),(182,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling Project #2 - Hanover, MD','This basement remodel in Hanover, MD features family room, which is ready for any sports event thanks in part to a large screen HDTV with deluxe sound system. Past a gorgeous decorative column is a sports tribute section. A masculine office area with dual monitors allows you to keep track of the latest sports trends.','Basement finishing and remodeling Hanover MD, basement renovation Hanover Maryland, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company.','basement-finishing-and-remodeling-hanover-md-14-06','Basement Finishing / Remodeling, Project #2','Hanover, MD','1916 Pometacon dr., Hanover, MD, 21076','39.141264','-76.7340354',1,390,1158,'<p>Are you a sports enthusiast? Why not fly your favorite teams&rsquo; colors just like this pristine sports den in Hanover, MD? This basement project by BasementRemodeling.com features a family room, painted latte with white trim and egg shell white ceiling, ready for any sports event thanks in part to a large screen HDTV with&nbsp;deluxe&nbsp;sound system, velvety futon couch, and modern serving table on wheels. Past a gorgeous decorative column is a sports tribute section, featuring a wide variety of memorabilia neatly arranged in a tasteful white cabinet stand with glass doors or framed on the wall. A masculine office area with dual monitors allows you to keep track of the latest sports trends with ease.</p>',0,68,'2020-09-22 18:49:17'),(183,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling Project #3 - Arlington, VA','In Arlington, VA, this basement remodel features LVT flooring, recessed ceiling with hidden LED lights unite to form a one-of-a-kind family room. A flashy wardrobe has a vintage-themed sink, LVT flooring, overhead vanity lamps, and plenty of room for clothing! The full bathroom includes tiled shower with sliding glass doors, and tile flooring.','Basement finishing and remodeling Arlington VA, basement renovation Arlington Virginia, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company.','basement-finishing-and-remodeling-arlington-va-13-10','Basement Finishing / Remodeling, Project #3','Arlington, VA','4317 24th St N Arlington, VA 22207','38.9024472','-77.11602119999999',1,880,1162,'<p>In Arlington, VA, there&rsquo;s one basement project in particular that&rsquo;s bold,&nbsp;inviting,&nbsp;and anything but ordinary! Bright colors, LVT flooring, an extra thin column, and a recessed ceiling with hidden LED lights unite to form a one-of-a-kind family room that has unforgettable character and loads of charm. A flashy wardrobe features a vintage-themed washing station (sink), LVT flooring, overhead vanity lamps, and, of course, plenty of room for clothing! The full bathroom includes tiled shower with sliding glass doors, matching tiled accent wall, and matching tiled floor &ndash; not to mention a beautiful built-in dresser complete with towel rack and supreme glass-plated shelving.</p>',0,69,'2020-09-22 18:51:00'),(184,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling Project, Hanover, MD | Basement Masters','This Hanover, MD basement remodel features tile flooring for the family room which has a full-size wet bar with a sink and wraparound black marble countertops. A full bathroom contains a tiled shower with tiled seat and frameless glass door. The guest closet has been converted into a laundry room with washer and dryer.','Basement finishing and remodeling Hanover MD, basement renovation Hanover Maryland, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company.','basement-finishing-and-remodeling-hanover-12-12','Basement Finishing / Remodeling','Hanover, MD','1734 Allerford Dr, Hanover, MD, 21076','39.1542042','-76.73782299999999',1,900,1170,'<p>Clean and modern is the impression this Hanover, MD basement project will give to anyone who stops by for a visit. Twin hanging lamps dangle over a full-size wet bar with a single-handle sink and wraparound black marble countertops; exquisite double doors make for picture-perfect entrances and lavishing exits. Down the staircase with divider wall awaits an open chestnut brown space with egress windows and soft lighting. A full bathroom with a light green theme contains a tiled shower with tiled seat and new curb along with towel rack, wall-mounted and double-wide. The guest closet has been converted into a laundry room with washer, dryer, and plenty of room left over for additional storage.</p>',0,70,'2020-09-22 19:05:18'),(185,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling Project - Silver Spring, MD','Simple but effective and spacious basement refinishing project for a home in Silver Spring MD by BasementRemodeling.com','Basement finishing and remodeling Silver Spring MD, basement renovation Silver Spring MD, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company, basement finishing, basement remodeling, basement design ideas, portfolio, basement contractor,','basement-finishing-and-remodeling-in-silver-spring-md','Basement Finishing and Remodeling','Silver Spring, MD','10207 Folk St, Silver Spring, MD, 20902','39.0239816','-77.0340251',1,900,1189,'<p>A completely refinished basement for a home in Silver Spring MD by BasementRemodeling.com. This 900 sq. ft. basement project features a spacious family room, a separate guest bedroom, a full-size bathroom, and soft carpeted flooring. The soft and consistent color-scheme that transitions from room to room seamlessly offers plenty of decorative options. Additionally, the family room includes a single decorative column, which offers a simple but effective template for strategically placing furniture, rugs, decorations, shelving, or an entertainment center.</p>',0,71,'2020-09-22 19:07:42'),(186,'Basement Finishing & Remodeling Project in Adamstown, MD','Fun and perky minimalist finished basement in Adamstown, Maryland. Basement Remodeling Company portfolio.','basement finishing project, Adamstown, MD, remodeling projects, portfolio','basement-finishing-remodeling-adamstown-md-19-04-19','Basement Finishing / Remodeling','Adamstown, MD','5891 Union Ridge Drive, Adamstown, MD 21710','39.30831970000001','-77.4666343',1,1200,1196,'<p>Elements of modern minimalism converge to create a fun and perky finished basement project in Adamstown, Maryland. A classy blend of natural light, wall lamps and hidden LED lighting makes darker furnishings pop against beige carpeting and a neutral color scheme in the family room. A delightful corner nook boasts soft furniture with round edges giving way to stylish center-opening barn doors. A decorative half-wall with column and LVT flooring designates the entranceway to a full-sized wet bar with wine storage, custom cabinets and modern appliances. White baseboard molding creates depth and symmetry throughout.</p>\r\n<p>Light colors on white door trim with LVT flooring enlarges the half-bathroom, which features a vanity sink, overhead lighting and extra-tall luxury faucet. A similar design choice opens up a second full-size bathroom that has a shower enclosure, hopper window, and double vanity sinks with luxury faucets under dual mirrors and overhead lighting.</p>',0,72,'2020-09-22 19:09:54'),(187,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling Project #7 - Ellicott City, MD','This Ellicott City, MD basement remodel features row lighting, decorative columns and a bulkhead. The family room has an entertainment area and the kids’ playroom behind. The music room with LVT flooring and wall-mounted guitar racks and also there is a large basement bedroom.','Basement finishing and remodeling Ellicott City MD, basement renovation Ellicott City Maryland, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company.','basement-finishing-and-remodeling-ellicott-city-md-15-05','Basement Finishing / Remodeling, Project #7','Ellicott City, MD','3600 Horned Owl Court, Ellicott City, MD','39.2722405','-76.8497919',1,1180,1206,'<p>This Ellicott City, MD basement project is the perfect place to play, rest, and grow as a family! Row lighting, decorative&nbsp;columns&nbsp;and a bulkhead&nbsp;gives&nbsp;the illusion of separate areas while still maintaining a wide open flow. The family room feels just right with stone gray walls and an enormous, peacock blue wraparound sectional sofa facing a hip home entertainment area. The kids&rsquo; space, complete with indoor slide and bright shelving, is safely nestled&nbsp;in&nbsp;the other end of the room, but still within eyesight of the family area. The music room changes to a soothing baby blue and has LVT flooring, awesome wall-mounted guitar racks, and a clean white desk area that&rsquo;s perfect for songwriting. The large bedroom is painted a soft butter yellow and features recessed lighting and tastefully modern furnishings.</p>',0,73,'2020-09-22 19:14:07'),(188,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling Project #2 - Boyds, Maryland','Another great basement project finished in Maryland by BasementRemodeling.com! Check out the pictures here!','basement remodeling, basement renovation, basement finishing, general contractor, basement contractor, Boyds, maryland, md, portfolio','basement-finishing-remodeling-boyds-md','Basement Finishing / Remodeling, Project #2','Boyds, Maryland','12600 Bright Spring Way, Boyds, MD 20841','39.215864','-77.261614',1,1200,1215,'<p>A tropical blue motif gives this Boyds, Maryland basement project an outdoorsy impression. Decorative columns and sparse recessed lighting (along with double hung windows and a glass door entrance) fully bathes the room in a pleasant combination of artificial and natural light, which only further accentuates the brilliant white wall trim. A narrow pocket door next to an equally narrow nook creates artistic levels of immersion and depth while also providing a clean and practical living space for your next family room or guest bedroom. The bathroom is simultaneously rustic and luxurious with white cabinets, marble sinktop, tri-window medicine cabinet, and shower with tub enclosure by Kohler.</p>',0,74,'2020-09-22 19:16:34'),(189,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling Project #3 - Boyds, MD','Basement remodeling brings cheer, tradition, and warmth to this finished basement in Boyds, MD. Check here for pictures and more details!','Basement finishing and remodeling Boyds, MD, basement renovation Boyds, MD, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company.','basement-finishing-remodeling-boyds-md-17-12','Basement Finishing / Remodeling, Project #3','Boyds, MD','18419 TAPWOOD ROAD, BOYDS MD 20841','39.1624238','-77.2905949',1,1000,1227,'<p>Basement remodeling brings cheer, tradition and warmth to this finished basement project in Boyds, MD. Traditional wood stairs with spindles and banisters create a classy descent into a clean basement with a blue-on-white finish, white baseboard molding, LVT flooring and hidden LED lights. The multi-purpose duality of basement remodeling means adding a red velvet pool table transforms this kitchen-like wet bar into a fabulous hybrid game room as well &ndash; and don&rsquo;t forget the mini-music room nestled to the right of the stairs. The privacy window and hidden LED lights make for a well-lit family room design complete with a simple cream sofa, wall-mounted HDTV and barn doors. A full-sized bathroom features a vanity sink with overhead lighting, LVT flooring and tiled shower with sliding glass doors.</p>',0,75,'2020-09-22 19:18:40'),(190,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling Project - McLean, Virginia','See what the right windows can do for your floor space by taking a look at this basement design project for a downstairs dwelling in McLean, VA!','Basement finishing and remodeling, basement renovation, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company, basement window ideas, McLean VA, basement finishing, basement remodeling, basement design ideas, portfolio, basement contractor','basement-finishing-remodeling-mclean-virginia','Basement Finishing / Remodeling','McLean, Virginia','1636 Evers Drive, McLean, VA','38.9233204','-77.19292999999999',1,450,1237,'<p>This McLean, VA basement project looks streamlined and lean itself with a wide open floor space that makes the most out of sandy colors, white ceiling, and marvelous LVT flooring. Notice how the wide window works well to further camouflage an already well-hidden access door. Hookups for a family room entertainment center can be seen in the corner, where an egress window can shine natural light onto family gatherings. The laundry room features a state-of-the-art washer-and-dryer hookup with clean white walls and a light grey floor &ndash; the ultimate design in terms of style and practicality.</p>',0,76,'2020-09-22 19:20:43'),(191,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling Project #3 - Annapolis, MD','This Annapolis, MD basement redesign project includes a modern family room with a home entertainment system, office space and a fireplace. See more here.','Basement finishing and remodeling Annapolis MD, basement renovation Annapolis Maryland, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company, basement finishing, basement remode