in with an official NHL&nbsp;regulation-size&nbsp;air hockey table and compartmentalized floor shelf with plenty of games and activities to choose from; cream and white colors combine with terrific lighting to open up both rooms to their fullest potential. When playtime is over, hit the baby blue gym room with cardio station, treadmill, and LVT flooring. In this basement, there&rsquo;s always plenty of time to stay and play!</p>',0,78,'2020-09-22 19:24:26'),(193,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling Project #2 - Pikesville MD','This Pikesville, MD basement remodel project features recessed lighting, a professional sound system, wet bar, gym room, laundry room, and more.','Basement finishing and remodeling Pikesville MD, basement renovation Pikesville Maryland, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company, basement finishing, basement remodeling, basement design ideas, portfolio, basement contractor','basement-finishing-and-remodeling-pikesville-md-14-09','Basement Finishing / Remodeling, Project #2','Pikesville, MD','1315 Saint Albans rd, Pikesville, MD,21208','39.375029','-76.73260499999999',1,1180,1254,'<p>This Pikesville, MD basement project is modern and luxurious thanks to massive improvements in style and structure. The family room is beautifully framed by a wraparound sectional leather sofa, and has LVT flooring, recessed lighting, a professional sound system, and an attractive pendant light ceiling fan that casts gorgeous shadows onto an eggshell white ceiling; the nearby wet bar prominently displays aged cabinetry and modern appliances, framed against a tiled accent wall. Directly adjacent is the nearby gym room, which features two workout stations in close proximity to a big-screen HDTV. A darling laundry room rests behind bi-fold doors, complete with washer and dryer, and&nbsp;small&nbsp;wet bar replete with overhead cabinetry. The full bathroom includes marble tiled floor, tiled shower with sliding glass doors and mosaic tiled pan, clear bowl sink, and granite countertop.</p>',0,79,'2020-09-22 19:26:48'),(194,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling Project - Owings Mills, MD','This Owings Mills, MD basement remodeling project features a decorative family room design, a gym room with LVT flooring, a full bathroom, and more.','Basement finishing and remodeling Owings Mills MD, basement renovation Owings Mills Maryland, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company, basement finishing, basement remodeling, basement design ideas, portfolio, basement contractor','basement-finishing-and-remodeling-owings-mills-md-11-11','Basement Finishing / Remodeling','Owings Mills, MD','4310 Winfield Dr, Owings Mills, MD 21117','39.3909276','-76.7953445',1,845,1264,'<p>A clean and chic design gives this Owings Mills, MD basement project a personable touch with dazzling depth. A sectional countertop hugs a lemon yellow family room and works in conjunction with a decorative column to give exciting visual definition. In addition, low furniture and a contemporary ceiling fan creates spacious angles. A gym room with LVT flooring has terrific workout equipment and a stunning standalone wooden wardrobe for a quick change. The full bathroom with a tub enclosure features blush walls against an immaculate white ceiling, extra wide sink, and tiled floor.</p>',0,80,'2020-09-22 19:29:04'),(195,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling Project #7 - Columbia, MD','This basement remodeling and finishing project in Columbia, MD by BasementRemodeling.com is designed with a combination of modern and rustic elements.','Basement finishing and remodeling Columbia MD, basement renovation Columbia Maryland, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company, basement finishing, basement remodeling, basement design ideas, portfolio, basement contractor','basement-finishing-and-remodeling-columbia-md-12-12','Basement Finishing / Remodeling, Project #7','Columbia, MD','9628 Hastings dr, Columbia, MD 21046','39.162844','-76.824274',1,340,1269,'<p>Modern elements mix