pany, basement finishing, basement remodeling, basement design ideas, portfolio, basement contractor','basement-finishing-and-remodeling-timonium-md-14-09','Basement Finishing / Remodeling, Project #2','Timonium, MD','102 Belfast rd, Timonium, MD, 21093','39.4376913','-76.6167889',1,1020,1283,'<p>Friendly and functional is the overall appearance of this comforting Timonium, MD basement project, which is designed to easily accommodate large gatherings. An antiquarian brown sectional sofa with trendy coffee table and egress window&nbsp;makes&nbsp;for terrific conversation in the family room. Guests can trickle into the small wet bar area with tasteful LVT flooring, bar stools, suspended shelving, corner cabinets with marble countertops, refrigerator by Whirlpool, and a clean eggshell white decorum with matching trim. Creativity abounds in a bright blue-on-white music room that is large enough to house two drum kits, guitar, and plenty of studio equipment. A soft and feminine full bathroom, painted a silky blush, gives warmth and texture with an elegantly framed vanity mirror, marble countertop side dresser and sink, and tub enclosure by Kohler.</p>',0,83,'2020-09-22 19:35:44'),(198,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling Project #4 - Frederick, MD','Ever think about converting your entire basement into a kids’ playroom? Check out this Frederick, MD project for some great playroom ideas!','Basement finishing and remodeling, basement renovation, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company, basement playroom ideas, Frederick VA, basement finishing, basement remodeling, basement design ideas, portfolio, basement contractor','basement-finishing-remodeling-frederick-md','Basement Finishing / Remodeling, Project #4','Frederick, MD','6311 Iverson Terrace North, Frederick, MD','39.4081591','-77.3386566',1,750,1285,'<p>Why not devote your entire downstairs to your children so that they have a large place to play and grow? That&rsquo;s what we aimed for with this Frederick, MD basement project, and the family couldn&rsquo;t be happier! A uniform grey appearance becomes bright and cheerful thanks to color children&rsquo;s stencils embroidering the perimeter of the kids&rsquo; playroom, which still looks distinguished thanks to a decorative column and stair railing with half-wall. Overall, a well-lit area with plenty of room for the kids to run around in &ndash; and a wide open view with no hiding spots so you can easily watch them at all times!</p>',0,84,'2020-09-22 19:37:43'),(199,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling Project - Laurel, MD','BasementRemodeling.com added multiple features to a plain basement for this project in Laurel, MD.','Basement finishing and remodeling Laurel MD, basement renovation Laurel MD, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company, basement contractor, finishing, remodeling, portfolio, wine storage, basement remodeling ideas, basement remodeling projects','basement-finishing-and-remodeling-laurel-md-1','Basement Finishing / Remodeling','Laurel, MD','10848 Rockland Drive, Laurel, MD, 20723','39.1401742','-76.8910345',1,1220,1304,'<p>A basement remodeling and refinishing project in Laurel MD by Basement Remodeling.com. The basement includes a family room, home theater, bedroom, and full bathroom&mdash;all with new remodeled features. The family room features LVT-flooring, a double-door walkout entrance, plenty of room for decorative ideas, and an abundance of natural light. The home theater is large enough to enjoy a nice acoustic sound and small enough to provide a private viewing experience for a small family or couple. The whole room is carpeted, the walls are an aesthetically pleasing dark-blue, and the entertainment center itself has a surround-sound system with ceiling speakers. The bedroom, which is large, carpeted, and has a closet, now has a brand-new egress window that allows natural light to flood in. While the full-bathroom is a little small, it manages to maximize the space without feeling crowded.</p>',0,85,'2020-09-22 19:39:34'),(200,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling Project - Mclean, VA','Bright and colorful basement project in Mclean VA designed by BasementRemodleing.com','Basement finishing and remodeling Mclean VA, basement renovation Mclean VA, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company, basement contractor, finishing, remodeling, portfolio, wine storage, basement remodeling ideas, basement remodeling projects','basement-finishing-and-remodeling-mclean-va-1','Basement Finishing / Remodeling','Mclean, VA','2012 great falls street McLean VA','38.9093173','-77.18394529999999',1,1724,1308,'<p>This basement remodeling/refinishing project by BasementRemodeling.com is chock full of features and colorful surprises. The LVT-floored family room features a medium-size wetbar with plenty of cabinetry, a microwave, and a mini-fridge. Nearby is a spacious area with a tasteful electric fireplace complimenting the end of the room. Aside from the lovely family room, the basement includes two bedrooms, one pink and one blue, a full-size bathroom, and a laundry area. The first bedroom has light-pink walls, an egress window, and is also floored with LVT. The second bedroom also includes its own egress window and LVT flooring, but the walls are colored a nice light-blue. The full-size bathroom has a shower surrounded by tile and a glass-door entrance. Near the exterior entrance/exit to the basement rests a small nook, perfect for placing large modern laundry appliances.</p>',0,86,'2020-09-22 19:42:04'),(201,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling in Herndon, VA — Basement Finishing and Remodeling in Maryland, DC and Virginia.','','','basement-finishing-and-remodeling-in-herndon-va','Basement Finishing / Remodeling','Herndon, VA','12806 Tewksbury Dr., Herndon, VA, 20171','38.92176000000001','-77.38485969999999',1,1055,1337,'',0,87,'2020-09-22 19:44:02'),(202,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling Project #2 - Annapolis, MD','Expertly designed and engineered minimalist basemen