dge perfect for entertaining guests. Nearby is a large room dedicated to providing the absolute optimal home-theater experience, with carpeted flooring, soft lighting, and plenty of room for seating. The full bathroom features a tiled shower with sliding glass doors, and plenty of space for decorating. To top it all off, the basement includes a full additional bedroom, perfect for hosting guests or family during the holidays!</p>',0,90,'2020-09-22 19:52:02'),(205,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling Project #2 - Laurel, MD','An open-concept design combined with stunning architecture form this incredible basement remodeling project in Laurel, MD.','Basement finishing and remodeling Laurel MD, basement renovation Laurel Maryland, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company, basement finishing, basement remodeling, basement design ideas, portfolio, basement contractor','basement-finishing-and-remodeling-laurel-14-01','Basement Finishing / Remodeling, Project #2','Laurel, MD','8028 Patuxent Landing Loop, Laurel, MD 20724','39.1154017','-76.8014963',1,1235,1400,'<p>Large, open space combines with dramatic architecture to form an incredible Laurel, MD basement dwelling. The family room of this basement project is right around the enclosed staircase, and features hardy LVT flooring, and plenty of design possibilities thanks to a cream color with white trim that will match almost any shade of furniture. Built-in cabinetry under the staircase adds extra storage opportunities, and just past it is the full-sized wet bar, complete with wraparound marble countertops, LVT flooring, and an abundance of cabinets. Through the French double doors is a cozy enclosure that would make the perfect kid&rsquo;s playroom or guest bedroom area. A full bathroom, painted&nbsp;egg shell&nbsp;white, has a classic marble countertop, overhead vanity lamps, a tiled floor, and a tiled tub surround.&nbsp;</p>',0,91,'2020-09-22 19:54:35'),(206,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling Project #2 - Springf