e window space. The cream-walls-with-white-trim continues around the corner into the small wet bar, complete with overhead cabinets, mini storage, granite countertop and a trendy mosaic accent wall &ndash; a large amount of closet storage space is adjacent from the wet bar. Finally, you&rsquo;ll love the cozy guest bedroom area complete with lavish red walls, white ceiling and trim, angled ceiling fan with lamps, and beige carpet.</p>',0,99,'2020-09-22 20:11:34'),(216,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling Project #2 - Frederick, MD','This basement in Frederick, MD gives off a crisp appearance throughout by using clean lines, different floor types, and walls.','basement remodeling, basement renovation, basement project, general contractor, basement finishing, Frederick, MD, basement design ideas','basement-finishing-remodeling-frederick-md-3','Basement Finishing / Remodeling, Project #2','Frederick, MD','1928 Timber Grove rd, Frederick, MD 21702','39.4640878','-77.411945',1,940,1526,'<p>This basement project in Frederick, MD uses clean lines and different floor types to delineate separate rooms with the use of walls, giving a crisp and open appearance throughout. A sky blue kitchen-like wet bar greets you as soon as you enter, complete with LVT flooring, stainless steel appliances, wraparound counter tops and hanging lamps mixed along with a casement window and recessed lighting. LVT flooring gives way to plush carpet and an abundance of space that would make for a great family room, where another casement window lets sunshine mix with recessed lighting. The lavender full bathroom has vanity lamps, LVT tiling and a shower enclosure with curb and bench.</p>',0,100,'2020-09-22 20:15:17'),(217,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling Project - Alexandria, Virginia','This basement in Alexandria, Virginia is now a stylish space full of possibilities for you and your family!','basement remodeling, basement renovation, basement project, general contractor, basement finishing, Alexandria, MD, basement design ideas','basement-finishing-remodeling-alexandria-virginia','Basement Finishing / Remodeling','Alexandria, Virginia','531 Fort Williams Pkwy, Alexandria, VA 22304','38.816975','-77.094499',1,800,1538,'<p>This basement project in Alexandria, Virginia is now a stylish space full of possibilities for you and your family! Down a flight of new wooden steps with half-walls is a uniform white appearance with a decorative column and darker LVT floors. Sparse recessed lighting draws the eye to key architectural highlights, such as the modest pocket door next to two doors that open from the center &ndash; a great family room or kids&rsquo; playroom. Around the second decorative column lies a kitchen-like wet bar with center island, overhead cabinetry, modern steel appliances, and granite countertops. The lavender full bathroom has contrasting dark floor tiling for a dramatically inviting effect, along with a single &nbsp;hung window with sill, a tiled shower with mosaic floor, raised curb and glass doors with half-wall, and a pocket door leading to a closet with wire shelving.</p>',0,101,'2020-09-22 20:23:17'),(218,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling Project - Frederick, Maryland','This basement in Frederick, Maryland looks timeless and classy after a complete remodel project from top to bottom!','basement remodeling, basement renovation, basement project, general contractor, basement finishing, Potomac, MD','basement-finishing-remodeling-frederick-3-md','Basement Finishing / Remodeling','Frederick, Maryland','9402 Bishopgate Dr, Frederick, MD 21704','39.3457902','-77.3355608',1,900,1564,'<p>This basement project in Frederick, Maryland looks timeless and classy after a complete remodel from top to bottom. Through the double glass door entrance lies a comfortable and stylish olive family room with recessed lighting and white trim. A small wet bar nicely fills out a nook, complete with dark cabinets, granite countertops, and a mini-refrigerator. Around the corner is the rest of the family room with a tray ceiling, wall-mounted HDTV, and access door. A cheerful half-bathroom has a luxury wash basin with vanity faucet, LVT flooring, overhead lamps and extra wide mirror.</p>',0,102,'2020-09-22 20:25:48'),(219,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling Project #2 - North Potomac, MD','Beautifully designed basement remodeling and finishing project in North Potomac, MD by BasementRemodeling.com.','Basement finishing and remodeling North Potomac, MD, basement renovation North Potomac, MD, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company, basement finishing, basement remodeling, basement design ideas, portfolio, basement contractor','basement-finishing-remodeling-north-potomac-md-17-08','Basement Finishing / Remodeling, Project #2','North Potomac, MD','13204 SQUIRES CT. N POTOMAC 20878','39.07212699999999','-77.267353',1,1200,1569,'<p>A beautiful standalone column sections this crisp white finished basement project in North Potomac, MD into four equal living spaces without the need for walls. A large and open family room is accentuated by hidden LED lights, two light-brown sofas and a contrasting dark wooden basement entertainment center with wall-mounted HDTV. LVT flooring extends from the family room to a beautiful full-sized bar with a half-wall island countertop and decorative half-column, wine storage and modern home appliances.</p>\r\n<p>Muted colors in the guest bedroom stay bright and cheerful with plenty of light shining in through double-hung window, hopper window and hidden LED lighting. The upgraded bathroom includes a tiled shower with sliding glass door, custom wraparound mosaic and wall tiling.</p>',0,103,'2020-09-22 20:28:10'),(220,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling Project #2 - Burke, VA','A finished basement project in Burke, VA creates a pleasant place for pets and family to cozy up together and call home. | BasementRemodeling.com portfolio','Basement finishing and remodeling Burke, VA, basement renovation Burke, VA, 