iances. Crossing a vast expanse of luxury carpet brings you to a large home theatre area with recessed lighting, projector and custom shelving for multimedia needs. The full-sized bathroom is equipped with vanity sink and mirror, granite countertops,&nbsp;tiled&nbsp;flooring, and shower enclosure made by Kohler.</p>',0,105,'2020-09-22 20:32:40'),(222,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling Project - Springfield, VA','Springfield, VA basement finishing project by BasementRemodeling.com. Wide-open and light-blue-on-white design full of practical uses design versatility.','Basement finishing and remodeling Springfield, VA, basement renovation Springfield, VA, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company.','basement-finishing-remodeling-springfield-va-17-11','Basement Finishing / Remodeling','Springfield, VA','7208 SAMPAL PL, SPRINGFIELD VA 22153','38.7606753','-77.24615059999999',1,600,1593,'<p>This basement finishing project in&nbsp;Springfield, VA creates a wide-open, light-blue-on-white space that is full of practical uses and unlimited design potential. Down the stairs with half-wall is a wall-mounted HDTV to serve as the foundation for a family room or a home gym. White baseboard molding and neatly-rowed recessed lighting wraps the eye around the room&rsquo;s perimeter and creates more visual space. A small wet bar with wine storage, overhead cabinetry, and accent wall receives plenty of light from elegant hidden cabinet lighting and the beautiful sliding door entrance. Further inside, an elegant full bathroom features a vanity sink with extra wide basin and shower enclosure by Kohler.</p>',0,106,'2020-09-22 20:34:25'),(223,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling Project - Kensington, MD','Elegant and uniformly designed finished basement in Kensington, MD by BasementRemodeling.com.','Basement finishing and remodeling Kensington, MD, basement renovation Kensington, MD, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company, basement finishing, basement remodeling, basement