roughout.</p>',0,115,'2020-09-22 20:50:43'),(232,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling Project - Silver Spring, MD','This Silver Spring, MD basement remodel project has double French doors, LVT flooring, laundry room with white cabinets, and a bathroom featuring LVT flooring, a vanity mirror, vanity knob, and more.','Basement finishing and remodeling Silver Spring MD, basement renovation Silver Spring Maryland, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company, basement finishing, basement remodeling, basement contractor, portfolio','basement-finishing-and-remodeling-silver-spring-md-16-02','Basement Finishing / Remodeling','Silver Spring, MD','1609 FOREST GLEN RD, SILVER SPRING MD 20910','39.0161304','-77.0379384',1,1000,1660,'<p>Warmth blends with beauty to create a Silver Spring, MD basement project with an open and inviting look &ndash; and ample closet space. Double French doors give depth and dimension to wide open rooms painted baby blue against a white ceiling and trim. LVT flooring creates a cozy appearance throughout. In one breathtaking corner, a picture window and dazzling drum overhead light work together to camouflage the state-of-the-art baseboard heater. A sleek laundry room features a washer and dryer combo with a sink atop white cabinets. The bathroom comes together with LVT flooring, deluxe vanity mirror with overhead lamps, a tiled shower with pull-out glass door and vanity knob, and a built-in ledge.</p>',0,116,'2020-09-22 20:52:43'),(233,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling Project - Chevy Chase, MD','This basement finishing project in Chevy Chase, MD is smart and sensible with neutral colors, decorative columns, and recessed lighting.','basement remodeling project, basement finishing project, Chevy Chase MD, Maryland, Chevy Chase, basement finishing, basement remodeling, basement contractor, portfolio','basement-remodeling-chevy-chase-md-19-04','Basement Remodeling','Chevy Chase, MD','3402 Cummings Lane, Chevy Chase, MD 20815','38.97855800000001','-