-09-22 21:01:25'),(238,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling Project #4 - Ellicott City, MD','This Ellicott City, MD basement remodeling project features a family room with recessed ceiling and LVT flooring, a cozy wet bar with dark overhead cabinetry and center wine rack, a multi-purpose room with recessed ceiling, and a full bathroom with a luxury sink and ceramic tiled flooring.','Basement finishing and remodeling Ellicott City MD, basement renovation Ellicott City Maryland, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company, basement finishing, basement remodeling, basement contractor, portfolio','basement-finishing-and-remodeling-ellicott-city-14-03','Basement Finishing / Remodeling, Project #4','Ellicott City, MD','3036 Carlee Run Court, Ellicott City, MD 21042','39.2839145','-76.87086099999999',1,990,1722,'<p>Marvelous architecture awaits you in this amazing Ellicott City, MD basement project retreat. At the bottom of a winding staircase is the family room, which has a glorious look and feel thanks to jade walls with white trim, recessed ceiling, and light-colored LVT flooring. In a cozy corner, guests can serve themselves at the walk-up wet bar, complete with dark overhead cabinetry and center wine rack, modern stainless steel appliances, and LVT planking. Around a stylish transitional bend lies a multi-purpose room with&nbsp;recessed&nbsp;ceiling that would be a terrific kid&rsquo;s playroom, for example. The striking monochromatic full bathroom is steeped in rich architecture and sharp angles, featuring a new shower enclosure, luxury&nbsp;sink&nbsp;and ceramic tiled flooring.</p>',0,122,'2020-09-22 21:03:26'),(239,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling Project #5 - Columbia, MD','This basement remodel in Columbia, MD includes a family room with shelving, decorative column, blush accent wall, and a quiet office. The full bathroom with sliding door shower enclosure.','Basement finishing and remodeling Columbia MD, basement renovation Columbia Maryland, finishing base