en area. High awning windows with deep sills helps to capture natural light, while sparse rows of recessed lighting help to maintain a bright and cheery atmosphere. The carpeted stairs with half-wall now also has understairs storage to free up even more space in a basement that is quite spacious as it is. Tasteful pinefrost green wall extend throughout the premises, leading into a luxurious bathroom with dual vanity lights, black cabinets, and Kohler shower enclosure.</p>',0,130,'2020-09-22 21:18:43'),(247,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling Project - Millersville, MD','This basement remodeling project in Millersville, MD has a family room with TV, gym room, and bathroom with a tub enclosure and tiled flooring.','Basement finishing and remodeling Millersville MD, basement renovation Millersville Maryland, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company, basement finishing, basement remodeling, basement contractor, portfolio','basement-finishing-and-remodeling-millersville-md-14-11','Basement Finishing / Remodeling','Millersville, MD','115 Fordam Dr, Millersville, MD 21108','39.1085346','-76.58117399999999',1,990,1808,'<p>This clean basement project with a modern look is located in Millersville, MD. Sharp angles and powerful architecture&nbsp;creates&nbsp;a uniquely wonderful space with ample decorating opportunities. The sugar cookie family room has white trim, trendy extra wide low-cut entertainment center, mounted HDTV, plaid furniture and double windows. Beyond the tall doorway with wraparound trim is a second family room with lowered&nbsp;book shelf, sectional olive sofa, and colorful floor chest. No modern downstairs would be complete without a full-size gym room featuring cornflower blue walls with neat white trim, wall-mounted HDTV, and several customized workout stations ready to push you to new physical heights. A shortbread-colored full bathroom feels flowery and warm with ceramic tiled flooring, an extra tall vanity mirror, and tub enclosure by Kohler.<