ing / Remodeling Project - Germantown, MD','Down the remodeled staircase with half-wall and pocket door lies a slate gray Germantown, MD basement project that has both style and function!','basement remodeling, basement renovation, basement project, general contractor, basement finishing, Germantown, MD, portfolio','basement-finishing-remodeling-germantown-4','Basement Finishing / Remodeling','Germantown, Maryland','5 Yellow Leaf Ct, Germantown, MD 20876','39.185407','-77.2280538',1,1200,1846,'<p>Down the remodeled staircase with half-wall and pocket door lies a slate gray Germantown, MD basement project that has both style and function. In the family room, recessed lighting combines with dual sliding windows to create the perfect atmosphere of natural and artificial lighting. Around the corner you&rsquo;ll find clever under-the-stairs storage just before the double French doors and just past the decorative column. A kids&rsquo; playroom, family room, wet bar, and more are all possibilities. A pale yellow bathroom features a tub enclosure by Kohler, overhead lamps, and immaculate white cabinetry.</p>',0,135,'2020-09-22 21:28:35'),(252,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling Project - Timonium, MD','This basement remodel project in Timonium, MD includes a big family room with entrance sliding doors and carpet flooring and a full bathroom with sliding-door shower enclosure and tiled floor.','Basement finishing and remodeling Timonium MD, basement renovation Timonium Maryland, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company, basement finishing, basement remodeling, basement contractor, portfolio','basement-finishing-and-remodeling-timonium-md-12-08','Basement Finishing / Remodeling','Timonium, MD','12 Laurel Cir, Timonium, MD 21093','39.4312006','-76.6473854',1,1100,1855,'<p>This sizeable Timonium, MD basement project is ready to meet your family&rsquo;s needs with plenty of storage space and an open floor design. The cloud gray theme with white floor trim and matching c