egues into&nbsp;ceramic&nbsp;tile for the full-size wet bar area, complete with dark wraparound cabinets, marble countertops, vanity sink, and elevated counter with contemporary furnishings. On the other side of the stairs is a spacious family room with wall-mounted HDTV, chocolate leather sectional sofa, baseboard heater, and elevated ledge for added visual depth. An open lemon yellow space with neutral carpet and wall-to-wall mirroring would make for a flashy dance studio or deluxe guest bedroom. A fierce cherry red full bathroom has a ceramic tiled floor, and a compartmental tiled shower with&nbsp;tiled&nbsp;floor that spares half the size, but none of the luxury.&nbsp;</p>',0,146,'2020-09-22 21:49:30'),(263,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling Project #2 - Columbia, MD','This basement project in Columbia, MD includes the family room with carpet flooring and under stairs storage. Half bathroom has a tiled floor.','Basement finishing and remodeling Columbia MD, basement renovation Columbia Maryland, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company,  basement finishing, basement remodeling, basement contractor, portfolio','basement-finishing-and-remodeling-columbia-md-12-06','Basement Finishing / Remodeling, Project #2','Columbia, MD','5355 Iron Pen Place, Columbia, MD, 21044','39.2268576','-76.877415',1,650,1922,'<p>Wide open spaces readily accommodate long-lasting family memories in this delightful Columbia, MD basement project. An eggshell white theme with matching white floor trim accentuates the vast floor space &ndash; which would make for the perfect family room, wet bar, or kids&rsquo; playroom &ndash; and showcases crisp architectural features such as bump-out corners and built-in storage under the stairs. A charming walkway with clean line breaks and ample closeting wraps around&nbsp;perimeter, opening up into a wonderful half bathroom with cream walls, extra wide sink, ceramic tiled floor and overhead vanity light.</p>',0,147,'2020-09-22 21:51:19'),(264,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling Project - Baltimore, MD','This basement remodel in Baltimore, MD features the family room with laminate flooring and wet bar. The full bathroom has a shower enclosure and tiled floor.','Basement finishing and remodeling Baltimore MD, basement renovation Baltimore Maryland, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company, basement finishing, basement remodeling, basement contractor, portfolio','basement-finishing-and-remodeling-baltimore-md-12-09','Basement Finishing / Remodeling','Baltimore, MD','8144 Glen Arbor Dr, Baltimore, MD 21237','39.3778984','-76.4908646',1,1050,1928,'<p>Why shouldn&rsquo;t your basement be a great recreational space to entertain guests? This Baltimore, MD basement project features a cream theme and plenty of room for your and friends. The entrance area would make for the perfect family room with tasteful recessed lighting, egress windows, and stylishly narrow decorative columns. Premium carpet gives way to scratch-resistant LVT planking in the full-size wet bar area, which retains the cream theme and decorative columns while adding marble sink countertops, a towering vanity faucet, luxurious overhead lamps, and full coverage natural lighting. A classic cloud gray full bathroom features a strikingly artistic floor cabinet, shower enclosure with raised curb, and matching ceramic tiled floor.</p>',0,148,'2020-09-22 21:53:11'),(265,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling Project - Reisterstown, MD','This Reisterstown, MD basement remodel includes a family room with carpet flooring, wet bar, and a full bathroom with a tub enclosure.','Basement finishing and remodeling Reisterstown MD, basement renovation Reisterstown Maryland, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company, basement finishing, basement remodeling, basement contractor, portfolio','basement-finishing-and-remodeling-reisterstown-md-12-09','Basement Finishing / Remodeling','Reisterstown, MD','317 Chamborley dr, Reisterstown, MD 21136','39.4465159','-76.83247589999999',1,1300,1934,'<p>You&rsquo;ve never seen a basement as pristine as this one in Reisterstown, MD. An all-white motif gives unparalleled depth and underscores the Roman-inspired architecture, featuring dramatic columns and sweeping line breaks. Clean space and rich angles greet you immediately from the doorway, heightened by tasteful recessed row lighting and elevated privacy windows. The project\'s medium wet bar features wall-to-wall cabinetry, ceramic tiled floor, and sink with marble countertops. A full bathroom features a vanity sink with extra wide marble countertop, overhead lighting, tub enclosure by Kohler, and ceramic tiled flooring.</p>',0,149,'2020-09-22 21:54:57'),(266,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling Project - Reston, Virginia','A soft and sensible basement remodel in Reston, VA uses a uniformly cream theme with white trim to create an atmosphere of fresh vitality and warm cheer.','basement remodeling, basement finishing, basement finishing company, remodel a basement, basement contractor, basement renovation, finished basement, basement refinish, Reston Virginia, Reston VA','basement-finishing-remodeling-reston-virginia','Basement Finishing / Remodeling','Reston, Virginia','12011 LAKE NEWPORT, RESTON, VA 20194','38.9806911','-77.364093',1,500,1946,'<p>A soft and sensible basement remodel project in Reston, VA uses a uniformly cream theme with white trim to create an atmosphere of fresh vitality and warm cheer. Down the staircase with half wall lies an open and intriguing main layout with ample closet storage space, making it the perfect spot for an entertaining kids&rsquo; playroom area. On the far side of the basement remodel lies a family room with a double-hung window and a wall-mounted HDTV underneath beautiful recessed lighting. The cream theme continues in the full-sized bathroom, complemented by a darling robin&rsquo;s egg blue dresser, cabinet and mirror. Notice the shower enclosure with sliding glass privacy door. &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>',0,150,'2020-09-22 21:56:55'),(267,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling Project - Bowie, MD','A newly remodeled basement in Bowie, MD makes use of neutral colors and white trimming to create attractive wide open spaces with plenty of design possibilities.','basement remodeling, basement finishing, basement finishing company, remodel a basement, basement contractor, basement renovation, finished basement, basement refinish, Bowie MD, remodeling project, finishing project','basement-finishing-remodeling-bowie2-md','Basement Finishing / Remodeling','Bowie, MD','2710 ADVENT CT. S. Bowie MD 20716','38.926856','-76.72848909999999',1,945,1953,'<p>A newly remodeled basement project in Bowie, MD makes use of neutral colors and white trimming to create attractive wide open spaces with plenty of design possibilities. Overhead recessed lighting combines with ample natural lighting to create soft and dramatic angles throughout the basement remodel. Beyond the beautiful white double doors grey carpet changes to light LVT flooring for a unique and subtle difference. Overall, a delightfully crisp and clean finish with a sense of modest luxury.</p>',0,151,'2020-09-22 21:58:57'),(268,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling - Boyds, Maryland','This wide-open basement remodel in Boyds, MD features a dazzling cream theme and an emphasis on relaxation and fun.','basement remodeling, basement finishing, basement finishing company, remodel a basement, basement contractor, basement renovation, finished basement, basement refinish, Boyds Maryland, Boyds MD, basement finishing, basement remodeling, basement contractor, portfolio','basement-finishing-remodeling-boyds2-md','Basement Finishing / Remodeling','Boyds, Maryland','14334 Ashleigh Greene rd, Boyds MD 20859','39.1582837','-77.30563029999999',1,1480,1961,'<p>This wide-open basement remodel project in Boyds, MD features a dazzling cream theme and an emphasis on relaxation and fun. Down the staircase with a half wall and railing, and beyond the ample storage closet, lies a spacious all-cream space with white trim and gorgeously soft lighting. Recessed overhead lighting mixes with natural light from sliding glass door entranceway and double-hung windows. The family area has a strikingly dark chestnut reclining couch sitting across from a large HDTV atop a deluxe entertainment center. Another double-hung window casts natural light upon the built-in book shelving in the far corner of the remodel.</p>',0,152,'2020-09-22 22:00:52'),(269,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling Project - Jessup, MD','This Jessup, MD basement remodel project features the family room with carpet flooring, a bedroom with laminate and half bathroom with tiled floor.','Basement finishing and remodeling Jessup MD, basement renovation Jessup Maryland, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company, basement finishing, basement remodeling, basement contractor, portfolio','basement-finishing-and-remodeling-jessup-md-11-11','Basement Finishing / Remodeling','Jessup, MD','2055 Orchard Ave, Jessup, MD 20794','39.1518067','-76.7651896',1,990,1963,'<p>This warm and inviting basement in Jessup, MD offers endless floor space and design possibilities galore! A wide open lemon yellow entranceway with twin egress windows, a plump tortilla-colored loveseat, dramatic&nbsp;row&nbsp;lighting, and dual columns would make for the ultimate family room, kids&rsquo; playroom, or media room &ndash; perhaps even a combination of all three! The festive yellow theme extends into a second spacious multi-purpose room with sturdy LVT flooring, extra wide ceiling&nbsp;lights&nbsp;and ample closet space. A full bathroom, painted soft buttermilk, features ceramic floor tiling, shower enclosure, and a wall-mounted vanity towel rack.</p>',0,153,'2020-09-22 22:02:42'),(270,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling Project - Ellicott City, MD','This Ellicott City, MD basement remodeling project features a big family room with carpet flooring, and a full bathroom with tile tub surround.','Basement finishing and remodeling Ellicott City MD, basement renovation Ellicott City Maryland, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company, basement finishing, basement remodeling, basement contractor, portfolio','basement-finishing-and-remodeling-ellicott-city-md-13-03','Basement Finishing / Remodeling','Ellicott City, MD','4566 College Ave, Ellicott City, MD 21043','39.2457867','-76.77553499999999',1,900,1969,'<p>Chocolate walls and a white ceiling gives dazzling depth to this breathtaking Ellicott City, MD basement project. Down the stairway with divider wall is a clean and open area that would make for a terrific family room or wet bar. Around the stairs, the room truly opens up into an endless array of beautiful row lighting and stylish architecture; premium carpeting gives a consistent look throughout. The full bathroom has all of the most modern amenities including an ornamental sink bowl with vanity faucet, overhead lighting, trendy dresser with pullout cabinets, tiled shower with inlay shelving and tub enclosure by Kohler, and ceramic tiled floor.</p>',0,154,'2020-09-22 22:04:12'),(271,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling Project #1 - Columbia, MD','This basement remodel project in Columbia MD includes the family room with carpet flooring and chairs, wall-mounted TV. A bedroom features an egress window, air conditioning, and more.','Basement finishing and remodeling Columbia MD, basement renovation Columbia Maryland, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company, basement finishing, basement remodeling, basement masters','basement-finishing-and-remodeling-columbia-md-12-12-1','Basement Finishing / Remodeling','Columbia, MD','12006 White cord way, Columbia, MD, 21014','39.2129353','-76.9009662',1,990,1974,'<p>This Columbia, MD basement project puts a limited amount of space to full use while looking fantastic. Beige walls, matching&nbsp;carpet&nbsp;and sitting furniture combine with a wall-mounted HDTV to compose a tidy family room that feels clean and comfortable. Around a stylish walkway with dual egress windows and closet space is a lemon yellow room with white trim that would make for a delightful kitchen-like wet bar, home office, kids&rsquo;&nbsp;play room, or even a media or music room. The lovely lavender guest bedroom has a charming dresser and ample window space. A full bathroom includes an extra wide vanity sink with arching faucet, shower enclosure, ceramic tiled floor, and a layered blue theme, rich with texture. &nbsp;</p>',0,155,'2020-09-22 22:05:50'),(272,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling Project #1 - Parkton, MD','This basement remodel in Parkton, MD includes a bedroom with LVT flooring and decorative windows. Hallway has a tiled floor as well as the full bathroom with shower enclosure.','Basement finishing and remodeling Parkton MD, basement renovation Parkton Maryland, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company, basement contractor, basement finishing, basement remodeling, portfolio, our work','basement-finishing-and-remodeling-parkton-md-12-01','Basement Finishing / Remodeling','Parkton, MD','21310 Dunk Freeland rd, Parkton, MD, 21120','39.709197','-76.611785',1,300,1982,'<p>A clean and modern basement is a great way to add both style and value to your home abode. This Parkton, MD basement project does just that with a friendly family room featuring LVT flooring, ample window space, and a warm two-tone motif of robin&rsquo;s egg blue walls and ceiling against cotton-white raised wall paneling. A brief section of LVT flooring kisses the bottom of the stairs before opening into a stupendous walkway with cloud gray walls, eggshell white ceiling, and an immaculate tiled floor. The full bathroom elicits an open and airy atmosphere with robin&rsquo;s egg blue walls on an off-white ceiling, dark tiled floor, and a shower enclosure with&nbsp;curb.</p>',0,156,'2020-09-22 22:07:15'),(273,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling Project #1 - Pikesville, MD','This basement project in Pikesville, MD features a family room with a column and a half bathroom with tiled floor.','Basement finishing and remodeling Pikesville MD, basement renovation Pikesville Maryland, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company, basement contractor, basement portfolio, basement design ideas','basement-finishing-and-remodeling-baltimore-md-12-07','Basement Finishing / Remodeling, Project #1','Pikesville, MD','2720 Moores Valley Dr, Baltimore, MD 21209','39.3868352','-76.6800124',1,765,1986,'<p>Light and airy describes this exquisite basement project in Pikesville, MD. Through the sliding&nbsp;glass&nbsp;entrance is a bright and open space with&nbsp;downhome&nbsp;architectural traits to give a traditional feel. A center column divides the area nicely into different design possibilities for a family room, kids&rsquo; room, games room, or even to convert the entire floor into a massive home theater with surround sound and perfect acoustics. The possibilities are endless! A nearby half bathroom is neat and tidy, featuring a marble sink countertop, ceramic tiled floor, and soothing neutral tones.</p>',0,157,'2020-09-22 22:08:48');
