INSERT INTO `text_content` VALUES (1,1,'content1','Welcome to BasementRemodeling.com'),(2,1,'content2','Professional and organized approach to your Basement Finishing or Remodeling project from the Local Family-Owned Company'),(3,1,'content3','Hundreds of Basements Finished'),(4,1,'content4','Most recent basement remodeling projects below and visit our portfolio to review many more of the recent basement finishing and remodeling projects.'),(5,1,'content5','Our News'),(6,1,'content6','See below where BasementRemodeling.com was featured on House Smarts, which was aired on CNBC back in September of 2019. This basement is located in Potomac, MD, and was completed by BasementRemodeling.com (ex- Basement Masters) during the Spring of 2019 for Mr. and Mrs. Terlinsky. Our whole team thanks Alan and Joan for the opportunity to transform their dream of a smart basement into a reality.'),(7,1,'content7','Want to know what our past clients have to say about their basement remodeling experiences with BasementRemodeling.com?'),(8,1,'content8','We love our clients and they love us!'),(9,1,'content9','The overwhelmingly positive reception from our clients makes BasementRemodeling.com stand out from other basement remodeling companies in Maryland. It definitely means something to us, and we think it should mean something to you, too!'),(10,1,'content10','Awards'),(11,1,'content11','BasementRemodeling.com is an award-winning basement remodeling and finishing company and one of the top remodeling companies in Maryland, DC Virginia. Click on the award badge to be transferred to our profile and learn more.'),(12,1,'content12','Follow us on Instagram'),(13,1,'content13','Look what you can have in your basement'),(14,1,'content14','Get inspired our Basement Ideas and save the best of them to your own collection.'),(15,1,'content15','Upfront transparent predetermined pricing for every client'),(16,1,'content16','We have upfront & transparent pricing policy. No unexpected spendings.'),(17,1,'content17','Our Professional Project Management Approach'),(18,1,'content18','At BasementRemodeling.com, we have a unique project management approach to make sure every basement remodel is completed in a timely fashion with quality results. Our highly organized timeline is the reason why we know exactly what is going on at the job site each and every day without fail. Unlike other basement remodeling companies in Maryland, we aren’t afraid to show it to you! Take a look at our basement remodeling timeline and find out why you are going to stay informed every step of the way.'),(19,1,'content19','Capable and Reliable Basement Remodeling and Finishing'),(20,1,'content20','Come visit our showroom and office in Rockville, MD to see our full flooring and cabinet selections! We want talk to you in person about your next project and show you around, so be sure to schedule an appointment in advance.'),(21,1,'content21','Service area'),(22,1,'content22','BasementRemodeling.com is a licensed and insured full service design-and-build remodeling company serving Washington DC, Maryland, and Virginia. Our headquarters and showroom are located in Rockville, MD, with warehouses located in Beltsville, MD, Baltimore, MD, and Arlington VA.'),(23,1,'content23','Why Choose BasementRemodeling.com'),(24,1,'content24','We are different than other Maryland basement remodeling companies:'),(25,1,'content25','Basement Remodel Financing Available'),(26,1,'content26','We’ve partnered with GreenSky Credit to offer excellent basement remodel financing options for free or at a low cost. You can instantly get basement remodel financing and enjoy a brand new basement in just a few weeks. Choose a basement remodel financing plan and apply for up to $55,000 right now. GreenSky Credit – the leading home improvement loans provider in the nation – offers a way to finally get basement finishing financing. No more tedious trips to the bank, no long approval processes, no additional paperwork required – just the capital you need to get basement remodel financing underway!'),(27,1,'content27','Licenses and Insurance'),(28,1,'content28','BasementRemodeling.com is a fully licensed and insured basement contractor in Maryland, Washington DC and Virginia. Our Virginia Class A Contractor License (VA Class A) number is 2705159425, our Maryland Home Improvement Commission License (MHIC) number is 129172 and our DC Class A Contractor License (DC Class A) number is 410516000631. We have posted copies of our basement remodeling licenses and insurance certificates below. Please note: any basement finishing or remodeling project requires a separate set of permits which should be pulled by a licensed contractor/electrician/plumber etc. You can easily check any contractors license here:'),(29,1,'content29','Basement Tips'),(30,13,'content30','<p>A basement is a great addition to any household, adding value to your property and giving your loved ones a place where they will all want to hang out and spend time together &ndash; not to mention entertain guests! Whether you are after a traditional basement with a fireplace and a casual atmosphere, a contemporary lounging area with chic furniture and dramatic angles, or an idea of a &nbsp;basement that&rsquo;s truly original, we have all of the materials and expertise necessary to make your basement ideas come true.</p>\n<p>On the other hand, if you have no basement ideas of your own, we will gladly create a basement that matches your exact lifestyle. From overstuffed sectional sofas to intimate loveseats, our design experts will choose the right sitting furniture based on your family&rsquo;s size and individual needs. Watch as coffee table centerpieces and other room accessories transform your downstairs dwelling from drab to fab. No matter what the size of the room, however, one thing always remains the same &ndash; a large screen HDTV and a stunning entertainment center for all to enjoy!</p>'),(31,13,'content31','Basement Ideas'),(32,1,'content32','OCTOBER 15, 2020'),(33,1,'content33','Exciting news! In-home consultations are free in maryland, washington, dc and virginia! Valid through june, 15, 2019. Regular price: $100');
